      "text": "Since 1974, the Thornhill Historical Society has championed the preservation of Thornhill’s rich history and architectural heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.thornhillhistoric.org/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The society has raised over a dozen heritage plaques to mark important sites throughout Thornhill.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.thornhillhistoric.org/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Visitors can explore Thornhill’s past on guided or self‑guided walking tours offered by the society.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.thornhillhistoric.org/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Thornhill Archives, stewarded by the society, preserve the town’s documentary heritage for future generations.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.thornhillhistoric.org/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Annual events such as Jane’s Walk, speaker gatherings, and a community bus trip keep Thornhill’s history alive and engaging.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.thornhillhistoric.org/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Registered as a Canadian charity under the Ontario Historical Society Act, the society operates as a non‑profit dedicated to Thornhill’s cultural legacy.",
